      "text": "**Number-average Mw (Mn)**: Arithmetic mean of all chains.\n  Mn = Σ(Ni × Mi) / Σ(Ni)\n  Sensitive to presence of short chains.\n  Measured by osmometry, end-group analysis."
    },
    {
