        "title": "Polymer Chemistry: Chains, Mw/Mn, and Tg",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Weight-average Mw (Mw)**: Each chain weighted by its mass.\n  Mw = Σ(Ni × Mi²) / Σ(Ni × Mi)\n  Sensitive to high-MW tail (long chains dominate viscosity).\n  Measured by light scattering, SEC-MALS."
    },
